(footprint "LED_3mm"
	(descr "3 mm THT LED, ORIGIN AT THE BODY CENTRE. Body/extents mirror the stock LED_THT:LED_D3.0mm that the board actually places -- but that stock footprint is origined on pad 1, 1.27 mm off the body centre. This centred variant exists so panel_geom.py/build_panel.py can reason about the LED where its panel hole actually is. Do not swap it onto the board.")
